  "details": "Description\n\nEverytime I go to paste a YouTube link to watch a video I get an error loading video. I've never had this problem before and now I've been having it for days. This applies to my PC and my Quest 2 and 3. AND I've cleared cache, uninstalled, reinstalled nothing works\t\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nThere are no work arounds. I simply cannot play any YouTube video. \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-21_19-11-41.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_57db1b4c-6550-43d4-a463-9a2419ccb2c7/1/file)",
